WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of S. Gilani (ASRG Construction, Kurnool), spoken in Urdu. Timings follow the edited cut.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Assalamu alaikum.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
My name is Sheikh Jilani.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
I work in construction.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
I have built a great deal: apartments, hospitals, banks and more.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.800
Recently we had our SEO set up here.

6
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.600
They did the SEO properly,

7
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.600
and now all the work we have done

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.400
shows up on Google. It is very good.

9
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:36.600
It benefits everyone. You should use it too.
